      "source_rule_id": "rule-2dd919bc012c069b3c8fffc3cbdb9c9070068f0c8eca42acdc492a3b3db5315a",
      "start_line": 108,
      "text": "  rule applyBin(\"%\", V:Val, I:Int)\n    => pyMod(projectIntTotal(V), I)\n    requires isInt(V)\n    [simplification]"
