      "normalized_sha256": "4e535e9503b7ea5138b6ee785a3c03b7668867ee0f420c22b82e5ec29594b231",
      "rationale": "Adds the unproved accumulator-lifted digitSum fold, relying on the recurrence and integer-addition rearrangement.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-4e535e9503b7ea5138b6ee785a3c03b7668867ee0f420c22b82e5ec29594b231",
      "start_line": 185,
      "text": "  rule T:Int\n       +Int ((N %Int 10 +Int 10) %Int 10)\n       +Int digitSum(\n         (N -Int ((N %Int 10 +Int 10) %Int 10)) /Int 10)\n    => T +Int digitSum(N)\n    requires N >Int 0\n    [symbolic(N), simplification]"
    }
