      "start_line": 124,
      "text": "  rule primeTail(N:Int, D:Int)\n    => notBool (pyMod(N, D) ==Int 0)\n       andBool primeTail(N, D +Int 1)\n    requires D >=Int 2 andBool D <Int N\n    [concrete, simplification]"
